---
title: Taco Seasoning
servings: 4
cuisine: mexican
main_protein: none
prep_time: "1 minute"
cook_time: "0 minutes"
tags:
  - dinner
leftover_portions: 0
prep:
  - Measure out the spices
  - Get a small bowl or jar ready
---

In a #small bowl{}, combine @chili powder{1%tbsp}, @ground cumin{2%tsp}, @paprika{1%tsp} (preferably smoked), @fine sea salt{1%tsp}, @ground black pepper{1%tsp}, @garlic powder{0.5%tsp}, @onion powder{0.5%tsp}, @dried oregano{0.5%tsp}, and @red pepper flakes{1%pinch} (optional). Mix well.

Store in an airtight container.
